      scheduler (866 rows) run through the documented command exits 2 with "383 rejected, 483
      accepted": 253 top-level-is-another-root, 76 unsupported https, 38 nonexistent, 15 not a git
      repository, 1 relative. The code-factory family is 19/19 PASS; the duckbrain family named in
      the docs table is 7 rejected, including the literal placeholder
